    {
      "sourceAlias": "S0060",
      "sourceId": "body[1]/p[61]",
      "text": "\u0110i\u1EC1u 8. C\u00E1c h\u00E0nh vi kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u00E0m",
      "previousSourceOccurrences": [
        {
          "sourceAlias": "S0058",
          "sourceId": "body[1]/p[59]",
          "text": "5. Tu\u00E2n th\u1EE7 c\u00E1c quy \u0111\u1ECBnh, h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt v\u1EC1 trao \u0111\u1ED5i d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u, v\u1EC1 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng c\u00F4ng ngh\u1EC7 th\u00F4ng tin trong c\u01A1 quan nh\u00E0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\u00E0 c\u00E1c nguy\u00EAn t\u1EAFc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c quy \u0111\u1ECBnh t\u1EA1i \u0110i\u1EC1u 5 c\u1EE7a Ngh\u1ECB \u0111\u1ECBnh n\u00E0y.",
          "documentOrder": 62
        },
        {
          "sourceAlias": "S0059",
          "sourceId": "body[1]/p[60]",
          "text": "6. Ph\u00F9 h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi Khung ki\u1EBFn tr\u00FAc Ch\u00EDnh ph\u1EE7 \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EED Vi\u1EC7t Nam.",
          "documentOrder": 63
        }
      ],
      "nextSourceOccurrences": [
        {
          "sourceAlias": "S0061",
          "sourceId": "body[1]/p[62]",
          "text": "1. C\u1EA3n tr\u1EDF ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i, quy\u1EC1n khai th\u00E1c v\u00E0 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u h\u1EE3p ph\u00E1p c\u1EE7a c\u01A1 quan, t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c, c\u00E1 nh\u00E2n theo quy \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a ph\u00E1p lu\u1EADt.",
          "documentOrder": 65
        },
        {
          "sourceAlias": "S0062",
          "sourceId": "body[1]/p[63]",
          "text": "2. Mua b\u00E1n, trao \u0111\u1ED5i, chia s\u1EBB d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tr\u00E1i quy \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a ph\u00E1p lu\u1EADt.",
          "documentOrder": 66
        }
      ],
